IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ba-licensing-control`

-- Broadcasting Act 1994, ss 8, 20, 30, 32-36, 41, 43, 44, 45D-45J, 46-48A and First and Second Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_broadcasting-act-1994.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 8, 46 and Second Schedule`

#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `free-to-air nationwide television`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `subscription nationwide television`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `free-to-air localised radio`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `a special interest television service`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `a video-on-demand service`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `a computer online service`
#ASSERT `the service is licensable` `a teletext service`
